# Frontend Implementation Plan - Creative Review App

## Tech Stack

| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|---------|
| Next.js 14 | Framework (App Router) |
| TailwindCSS | Styling |
| Konva.js | Canvas drawing |
| ag-psd | PSD parsing |
| @esotericsoftware/spine-player | Spine animations |
| @supabase/supabase-js | Backend integration |

